      "description": "Posh is a social, events platform built for real life experiences. From festivals and parties to run clubs, fashion shows, and more, it's on Posh. Find events near you, see what the vibe is and who's going, and get tickets in seconds. Get off your phone and find your world.\n\nFIND EVENTS NEAR YOU\n- Scroll a personalized feed of events made for your taste\n- Discover nightlife, festivals, fashion, art, food and drink, fitness, and networking near you\n- See the full vibe with photos and video before you go\n- Check who's hosting and who's going before you buy\n\nGET TICKETS IN SECONDS\n- RSVP or buy tickets in a few taps with Apple Pay, card, or debit\n- Save the events you're into so you never miss a drop\n- Keep all your tickets in one place, ready to scan at the door\n- Get a heads up when your favorite organizers post something new\n\nFOLLOW YOUR PEOPLE\n- Follow your friends and the organizers you love\n- See which events your friends are going to\n- Send an event to your group chat in a tap\n- Build a profile that shows off everything you've been to\n\nWANT TO THROW YOUR OWN? \n- Posh gives you everything you need to create, sell out, and scale any event you can dream up\n- Build a one of a kind event page in minutes\n- Sell free or paid tickets with multiple tiers, limits, and promo codes\n- Get discovered on the Posh marketplace feed\n- Turn your guests into promoters with Kickbacks\n- Take payments at the door and cash out in seconds with Instant Payouts\n- Scan tickets and run the door right from your phone\n\nFind your world on Posh.",
